  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6a7262e9d93707a4e9f3d972ad34ef36, type: 3}
  m_Name: New QR Code Data 18
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "Kalibrasyon Cihaz\u0131"
  title: "Kalibrasyon Cihaz\u0131"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Kalibrasyon cihaz\u0131, VLF ve Tan Delta testleri \xF6ncesinde \xF6l\xE7\xFCm
    sisteminin do\u011Fru \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 do\u011Frulamak
    ve kabloya ait parametreleri belirlemek amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. \xD6zellikle
    kablonun uzunlu\u011Funun (metraj\u0131n\u0131n) \xF6l\xE7\xFClmesini sa\u011Flayarak
    test cihaz\u0131n\u0131n \xF6l\xE7\xFCm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131n do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde
    yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. Ayr\u0131ca \xF6l\xE7\xFCm
    s\u0131ras\u0131nda olu\u015Fabilecek sinyal zay\u0131flamalar\u0131 veya dalgalanmalar\u0131n
    de\u011Ferlendirilmesine katk\u0131 sa\u011Flayarak test sonu\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n
    g\xFCvenilirli\u011Fini art\u0131r\u0131r. Do\u011Fru kalibrasyon, VLF ve Tan
    Delta testlerinin hassas ve do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde ger\xE7ekle\u015Ftirilebilmesi
    i\xE7in \xF6nemli bir ad\u0131md\u0131r."
